.TH ferry-receive 1  Ferry "Ferry Manual"
.SH NAME
ferry\-receive \- Download a file shared by TICKET
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBferry receive\fR [\fB\-\-lang\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fITICKET\fR> [\fIOUTPUT_DIR\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Download a file shared by TICKET
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-lang\fR \fI<CODE>\fR
Interface language for this run (`en`, `pl`); overrides the saved setting
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fITICKET\fR>
Share TICKET printed by `ferry send` or shown by the GUI
.TP
[\fIOUTPUT_DIR\fR]
Destination folder (default: the download folder)
